menu "PMIC cold boot"

    config PMIC_COLD_BOOT_HOST_DRAIN
        bool "Hold the reset until the host has read the crash output"
        default n
        help
            The PMIC power cycle drops the USB-Serial/JTAG port, and the host
            loses whatever it had not read yet. A development or diagnostics
            build waits before the cycle; a release build does not.

endmenu
